DeepFilterNet3 — third-party model assets
=========================================

The files in this directory are derived from DeepFilterNet by Hendrik Schröter
and contributors: https://github.com/Rikorose/DeepFilterNet

They are NOT ChurchBridge code and are NOT covered by the ChurchBridge license.
They are redistributed under the MIT License, reproduced in full below.

DeepFilterNet is dual-licensed under MIT or Apache License 2.0 at the user's
option. ChurchBridge elects the MIT License.

Contents of this directory:

  DeepFilterNet3.mlmodelc/   Core ML compilation of the DeepFilterNet3 model
  auxiliary.npz              Window, ERB filterbank, and normalization state
                             required by the streaming signal chain

Modifications: these artifacts were converted from the upstream released model
to Apple Core ML format (via coremltools 8.3.0 from a TorchScript export,
torch 2.3.1). The model architecture and trained weights are upstream's; the
conversion is not.

If you use the DeepFilterNet3 model, the upstream project asks that you cite:

  Schröter, H., Rosenkranz, T., Escalante-B., A. N., and Maier, A.
  "DeepFilterNet: Perceptually Motivated Real-Time Speech Enhancement."
  INTERSPEECH, 2023.

